{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56925","headline":"莆阳古谶 · 佚名","name":"莆阳古谶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自湖腰欲断，莆阳朱紫半。\n水遶壶公山，此时大好看。\n（见宋李俊甫《莆阳比事》卷一）（〖1〗原注云：「《搜神秘览》云：『壶公山欲断，莆阳朱紫半。\n』讹矣。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}